      "message": "Hi, I agree that the wording of `Vol 4, Part E, 7.7.65.1 LE Connection Complete event` seems to suggest that on failure case it\u0027s only sent to the initiator.\nHowever there is a diagram on `Vol 6, Part D, 3.2 DIRECTED ADVERTISING` which shows the event being sent to the peripheral\u0027s side even without the initiator sending a `LE Create Connection`.\nTo me it looks contradictory and I\u0027m a bit hesitant to remove the code.\n\nA slight tangent: I think if this is regarded as a dead code, then the whole `if` block should be as well. But looks like the `if` block here is to handle the directed advertising case.",
